    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "58 Galtymore Close, Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present No.58 Galtymore Close to the market. This fine 3 bedroom property comes to the market ideal for first time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nNumber 58 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, cafes, sports facilities and schools as well as being within close proximity of Rialto and Kilmanham. \r\n\r\nWalking up to the property you are immediately met with a small entrance porch which adds that little bit of extra security. As you walk through the front door you have a bright and open hallway, setting the tone for the rest of the property. Off this you have a good sized front reception room which leads you back into a spacious dining room which would make for a great entertaining space. Downstairs also comprises a small but convenient kitchen.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a large built shed, which could be utilised for storage or converted into a home office space. You are also left with a nice bit of private garden space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs you will find a large double bedroom alongside a fully tiled family bathroom to the rear and a double alongside a single bedroom to the front aspect.\r\n\r\nThis property benefits from fantastic public transport links with several bus routes running throughout the area. The Luas Red line is also only a short 10 minute walk away which makes access to the City Centre very convenient.\r\n\r\nThis property will be popular so early viewing is advised.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Large shed to the rear\r\n- Public transport links\r\n- Classic features"
      },
